            }
          }
        },
        {
          "resource_id": "monster_action",
          "stats": {
            "action_name": {
              "value": "Sky And Heaven Stance"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(stance)\n\nShristi enters a combat stance perfected by past champions of the Challenge of Sky and Heaven. While in this stance, the only Strikes Shristi can make are skyward slash unarmed attacks. These deal 1d10 slashing damage; are in the brawling; and have the nonlethal, unarmed, and versatile traits.\n\nWhile in Sky and Heaven Stance Shristi gains resistance 2 to electricity and sonic damage."
            },
